  "label": "Military Service and Sacrifice",
  "description": "The concept that individuals who serve in the military, especially those who die in service, are deserving of special recognition, respect, and benefits. The meme invokes this concept to contrast the woman’s perceived undeservingness with the man’s sacrifice, implying that his death should be honored while hers should not.",
